, por favor.","en":"Again, please.","ja":"もう一度お願いします。","type":"phrase","lv":1},{"es":"Más despacio, por favor.","en":"More slowly, please.","ja":"もっとゆっくりお願いします。","type":"phrase","lv":1},{"es":"¿Me puedes repetir?","en":"Can you repeat that?","ja":"もう一度言ってもらえますか？","type":"phrase","lv":1},{"es":"Un momento.","en":"One moment.","ja":"ちょっと待って。","type":"phrase","lv":1},{"es":"Vamos.","en":"Let's go.","ja":"行こう。","type":"phrase","lv":1},{"es":"¿Dónde está el baño?","en":"Where is the bathroom?","ja":"トイレはどこですか？","type":"phrase","lv":1},{"es":"¿Cuánto cuesta?","en":"How much is it?","ja":"いくらですか？","type":"phrase","lv":1},{"es":"¿Qué hora es?","en":"What time is it?","ja":"何時ですか？","type":"phrase","lv":1}]